namtor (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Daemon, worker, setuid spawn helper, CLI, PAM module, systemd units.
  * Transactional PAM install/uninstall scripts under /usr/share/namtor.
  * Models fetched at runtime per model-manifest.toml after licence
    acceptance (NAMTOR_ACCEPT_LICENCE=1).

